WEBVTT

00:00:01.500 --> 00:00:04.770
Desertification is a difficult problem for the whole world.
荒漠化是全世界面临的一个难题。

00:00:05.570 --> 00:00:12.460
For many years, Chinese scientists have had rich experience in dealing with desertification in Northwest China.
多年来，中国科学家在治理中国西北地区的荒漠化方面一直有着丰富的经验。

00:00:13.260 --> 00:00:18.240
Now they are working to help African countries turn their sandy areas into green ones.
如今，他们正努力帮助非洲国家把本国的沙地变成绿地。

00:00:19.040 --> 00:00:24.530
China has made great progress through hard work, though it is seriously affected by desertification.
尽管中国受到荒漠化的严重影响，但通过艰苦努力，已经取得了巨大进步。

00:00:25.330 --> 00:00:31.460
By November 2024, China had built a long wall of trees, which caught the world’s attention.
到2024年11月，中国已经建成了一道长长的树墙，引起了全世界的关注。

00:00:32.260 --> 00:00:35.100
It is 3,046 km long!
它全长3046千米！

00:00:35.900 --> 00:00:39.680
And China has created 32 million hectares of new forest.
而且，中国已经新造林3200万公顷。

00:00:40.480 --> 00:00:45.360
Chinese scientists shared the technologies with Mauritania, an African country.
中国科学家与非洲国家毛里塔尼亚分享了治沙技术。

00:00:46.160 --> 00:00:51.880
They introduced different kinds of plants from China and used straw checkerboards to stop sand from moving.
他们从中国引进了不同种类的植物，并用草方格来阻止沙子移动。

00:00:52.680 --> 00:00:55.520
They developed new ways to save water for farming.
他们研发出了节约农业用水的新方法。

00:00:56.320 --> 00:01:03.270
Smart technologies such as robots, drones and sand-blocking systems driven by solar panels also helped a lot.
机器人、无人机以及由太阳能电池板驱动的阻沙系统等智能技术也帮了大忙。

00:01:04.070 --> 00:01:08.010
The China-Africa Green Technology Park was built in Mauritania.
中非绿色技术园在毛里塔尼亚建成。

00:01:08.810 --> 00:01:13.370
In 2024, the park was empty land swept by wind and sand.
2024年，这个园区还是一片风沙席卷的空地。

00:01:14.170 --> 00:01:18.030
Just one year later, there were grasses, fruits and vegetables.
仅仅一年后，这里就有了青草、水果和蔬菜。

00:01:18.830 --> 00:01:27.430
Wang Yongdong, a senior engineer from China, said, “The goal of the park is not only to protect the environment but also to help local people.”
来自中国的高级工程师王永东说：“园区的目标不仅是保护环境，而且是帮助当地人。”

00:01:28.230 --> 00:01:35.310
So far, China has trained 45 skilled workers and created 120 jobs for the local community.
到目前为止，中国已经培训了45名技术工人，并为当地社区创造了120个就业岗位。

00:01:36.110 --> 00:01:41.150
The Mauritanian environment minister described China as a “very important partner”.
毛里塔尼亚环境部长称中国为“非常重要的伙伴”。

00:01:41.950 --> 00:01:46.670
To help African countries, Chinese scientists have overcome many difficulties.
为了帮助非洲国家，中国科学家克服了许多困难。

00:01:47.470 --> 00:01:54.370
As a key member fighting against desertification in the world, China promises to keep working and make bigger efforts.
作为世界上抗击荒漠化的关键一员，中国承诺将继续奋斗，并付出更大的努力。

00:01:55.170 --> 00:01:58.420
Wang said, “We are a community with a shared future.
王永东说：“我们是命运共同体。

00:01:59.220 --> 00:02:01.310
We hope our efforts will show this spirit.”
我们希望自己的努力能体现这种精神。”
